{
  "demonstrationId": "DEMO-7",
  "narration": {
    "narrationId": "NARRATION-7",
    "text": "This invoice was blocked but I want to check it properly before releasing anything. I read the invoice quantity and unit price, then the purchase order to confirm the agreed quantity and price, then the goods receipt to confirm what was actually delivered. I also read all three processing rules so I know the tolerances I am working to rather than relying on memory. Invoiced quantity matches what was received and the price matches the purchase order exactly, so there is no variance to assess against the tolerance. Nothing is in dispute, so I am releasing it."
  },
